   "U027": "Lots, casinos and bosses",
   "U028": "### Lots, casinos and bosses\n\nA **lot** is a board space without a casino tile. Your marker on a lot makes it yours. Once built, it is a casino space, no longer a lot; your die on its tile represents your ownership/influence there.\n\nA **casino** is one tile or an edge-connected group of same-color tiles on the same block. Same-color edge neighbors merge immediately into one casino, even if their dice belong to different players. Diagonal contact alone does not connect them; casinos cannot be subdivided after joining.\n\nThe **boss** is the player owning the **highest individual die** in that casino, not the most dice or the highest sum of pips. Several highest dice belonging to the same player are sufficient to make that player boss. Resolve highest ties between different players immediately as described under **Boss ties**."
 },
